# Testing

All tests live in dedicated trees. Never colocate `test_*.py` or `*_test.dart` next to production source.

| Tree | Role |
|---|---|
| `backend/tests/unit/` | Domain services, lint, resolvers — no DB |
| `backend/tests/integration/` | API + Postgres |
| `apps/mobile/test/` | Dart unit + widget tests |

Rules:

- Every new domain service and API route gets tests in the same session.
- Unit tests must not require Docker. Integration tests may use Postgres from `docker-compose`.
- Prefer testing behavior (inputs → outputs) over mocking internals.
- Flutter: test `TerminologyResolver` and screens that render resolved terms.
- Run `pytest` from `backend/` and `flutter test` from `apps/mobile/` before considering a slice done.
